  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Mocha Milkshake.png|left|184x184px|Mocha Milkshake]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 125\n |price = 1 to 856\n |time = 30 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|milkshakeb|bigger|link=Milkshake Bar}}\n |xp = 102\n |base = 238\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 25 min\n}}\n'''Mocha Milkshake''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 125. It was added in winter 2023 update.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making Mocha Milkshake'''===\n[[File:Milkshake Bar.png|150px|left|Milkshake Bar]]\nMocha Milkshake are made in the [[Milkshake Bar]].\n\nTo make Mocha Milkshake, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Chocolate Ice Cream.png|75px|Chocolate Ice Cream|link=Chocolate Ice Cream]]\n|[[File:Espresso.png|75px|Espresso|link=Espresso]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|}\nIt takes 30 Minutes to make Mocha Milkshake, and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] machine. Each unit gives players 102 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling Mocha Milkshake'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Mocha Milkshake can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 8,568 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a Mocha Milkshake costs 838 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 1 Mocha Milkshake per crate, up to a total of ? per boat.\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Mokka-Milchshake\n|es = Batido de moca\n|it = Milkshake al mocaccino\n|no = Mochamilkshake\n|ru = Кофейный милкшейк\n}}\n[[pt-br:Milk-shake de mocha]]\n\n[[Category:Milkshake Bar Products]]\n[[Category:Chocolate Ice Cream Products]]\n[[Category:Espresso Products]]",
